### UC02 – Confirm Tour Booking (happy path)
# Prerequisite: first create a booking with UC01 and copy the returned bookingId below.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm

### UC02 – Error: booking not found (404)
# A random UUID that does not exist in the system.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm

### UC02 – Error: invalid state transition (409)
# Prerequisite: create a booking (UC01) and confirm it once (UC02 happy path above).
# Attempting to confirm an already-CONFIRMED booking triggers InvalidBookingStateException.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm
